msgid "An oasis surrounded by mountains and desert. Farmlands near the water's edge provide much-needed boost in farming, but foraging and hunting are in short supply."
msgstr "Oáza obklopená horami a púšťou. Pôda pri brehu posilňuje roľníctvo. Príležitostí na lov a zber je však nedostatok."

